Final output schema: {"$defs": {"HedgePlanV2": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"objective": {"title": "Objective", "type": "string"}, "target_hedge_ratio": {"title": "Target Hedge Ratio", "type": "string"}, "main_position_id": {"title": "Main Position Id", "type": "string"}, "hedge_position_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Hedge Position Id"}, "ratio_basis": {"const": "absolute_mark_notional", "title": "Ratio Basis", "type": "string"}, "expected_effect_on_exposure": {"title": "Expected Effect On Exposure", "type": "string"}, "costs": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Costs", "type": "array"}, "unlock_condition": {"title": "Unlock Condition", "type": "string"}, "failure_condition": {"title": "Failure Condition", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["objective", "target_hedge_ratio", "main_position_id", "hedge_position_id", "ratio_basis", "expected_effect_on_exposure", "costs", "unlock_condition", "failure_condition"], "title": "HedgePlanV2", "type": "object"}, "ManagementEvidence": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"observations": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Observations", "type": "array"}, "evidence_for": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence For", "type": "array"}, "evidence_against": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence Against", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["observations", "evidence_for", "evidence_against"], "title": "ManagementEvidence", "type": "object"}, "ManagementExecution": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"orders": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Orders", "type": "array"}, "cancel_order_ids": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Cancel Order Ids", "type": "array"}, "replace_orders": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Replace Orders", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["orders", "cancel_order_ids", "replace_orders"], "title": "ManagementExecution", "type": "object"}, "ManagementRisk": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"exposure_before": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Exposure Before", "type": "array"}, "exposure_after": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Exposure After", "type": "array"}, "protection_status": {"enum": ["adequate", "inadequate", "unknown", "not_applicable"], "title": "Protection Status", "type": "string"}, "costs_considered": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Costs Considered", "type": "array"}, "uncertainty": {"enum": ["high", "medium", "low"], "title": "Uncertainty", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["exposure_before", "exposure_after", "protection_status", "costs_considered", "uncertainty"], "title": "ManagementRisk", "type": "object"}, "MarketAnalysisRequestV1": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"schema": {"const": "brooks.market-analysis-request.v1", "title": "Schema", "type": "string"}, "request_id": {"title": "Request Id", "type": "string"}, "symbol": {"title": "Symbol", "type": "string"}, "decision_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Decision Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "timeframes": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Timeframes", "type": "array"}, "market_fields": {"items": {"enum": ["ordered_ohlc", "bar_by_bar", "decision_time"], "type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Market Fields", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["schema", "request_id", "symbol", "decision_time_ms", "timeframes", "market_fields"], "title": "MarketAnalysisRequestV1", "type": "object"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"schema": {"const": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "title": "Schema", "type": "string"}, "role": {"const": "POSITION_MANAGER", "title": "Role", "type": "string"}, "decision_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Decision Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "action": {"enum": ["HOLD", "REDUCE", "CLOSE", "HEDGE", "INCREASE_HEDGE", "REDUCE_HEDGE", "REMOVE_HEDGE", "REQUEST_MARKET_ANALYSIS", "RECONCILE_STATE", "MANAGEMENT_BLOCKED"], "title": "Action", "type": "string"}, "position_ids": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Position Ids", "type": "array"}, "reason": {"title": "Reason", "type": "string"}, "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementEvidence"}, "risk": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementRisk"}, "execution": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementExecution"}, "hedge_plan": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/HedgePlanV2"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "market_analysis_request": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/MarketAnalysisRequestV1"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "conditions_that_change_action": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Conditions That Change Action", "type": "array"}, "reduce_fraction": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Reduce Fraction"}, "shadow_mode": {"default": false, "title": "Shadow Mode", "type": "boolean"}}, "required": ["schema", "role", "decision_time_ms", "action", "position_ids", "reason", "evidence", "risk", "execution", "hedge_plan", "market_analysis_request", "conditions_that_change_action"], "title": "ManagementDecisionV2", "type": "object"}
Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1790002799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790026200000, "account": {"equity": "9994.216379133462", "available_margin": "9906.180623133462400000000000", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1790026200000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2768.42", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790026200000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "2.974103904"}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2768.42", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790026200000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "2.974103904"}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1790026200000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "fills_read_status": "available", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-9", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "position_id": "wf-main-5", "config": {"stop_price": "2718.090000000000000000000000", "target_price": "2812.139999999999999999999999"}}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [{"fill_id": "wf-fill-9", "order_id": "wf-fill-9", "position_id": "wf-main-5", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "status": "FILLED", "quantity": "0.159", "price": "2749.714944", "fee": "0.1748818704384", "filled_at_ms": 1790005679999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790024399999, "market_context": {"primary_regime": "bull trend on H4/D1 in breakout-spike phase; M15 in a post-spike pause", "location": "close 2781.77 sits above the broken H4 range top 2700.00 and the D1 ceiling 2557.46, in the upper part of the M15 post-spike range (low of the pause 2734.22 to the leg high 2804.59), below the 2795.00 M15 spike high and the 2850.00 H4 spike high", "timeframe_alignment": "H4 and D1 context both always-in long; H1 closes rising (2740.89, 2756.61, 2760.51, 2781.77); M15 shows a two-bar inside-bar pause (ii) after bull bar 117", "strongest_opposite_case": "H4 bar 118 is a possible buy climax (range 191.94, upper tail 126.85 = 66% of range, close in lower third) and M15 bars 118-119 never exceeded bar 117's 2804.59 high, so a break below 2776.10 would mark a failed break above 2795.00 and shift the read to a deeper pullback toward 2734.22-2718.09"}, "setup": {"type": "continuation buy on an ii (two consecutive inside bars) after a strong bull bar in a bull trend; stop entry above the pattern's high", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "clear", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "continuation", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high", "price_field": "high", "price": "2784.90", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790023500000, "close_time_ms": 1790024399999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 low", "price_field": "low", "price": "2776.10", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790023500000, "close_time_ms": 1790024399999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 118 (open_time 1790022600000, o 2803.69 / h 2804.14 / l 2783.49 / c 2783.49) is an inside bar of bar 117 (h 2804.59 / l 2769.78), and bar 119 (open_time 1790023500000, o 2783.49 / h 2784.90 / l 2776.10 / c 2781.77) is an inside bar of bar 118: an ii continuation pattern formed directly after bull bar 117 (o 2771.06, c 2803.78, close in the top quarter of its 34.81 range).", "M15 bar 117 broke the prior spike high 2795.00 of bar 99 (h 2795.00, c 2754.31) and closed 2803.78, so bulls still own the leg; the two-bar pause held 5.69 points above bar 117's low 2769.78 with no lower low under the spike bar.", "H1 (current): closes 2740.89 (bar 116), 2756.61 (bar 117), 2760.51 (bar 118), 2781.77 (bar 119) rise, and H1 bar 119 printed the window's highest H1 high 2804.59, above bar 114's 2795.00.", "H4 context (current at 1790020799999, always-in long, relevance high, breakout mode): H4 bars 118-120 close 2723.15 / 2754.31 / 2760.51 above the broken 2700.00 range top after six successive higher swing lows (2358.62, 2370.54, 2435.71, 2486.12, 2568.16, 2718.09) with no lower low in about 34 bars.", "D1 context (current): the first sustained closes above the 2557.46 ceiling (2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90) place the entry above a resolved D1 range, not in a range middle.", "Risk is defined by two exact M15 fields of the pattern bar: trigger 2784.90 (bar 119 high) versus invalidation 2776.10 (bar 119 low), 8.80 points, with the leg high 2804.59 and the H4 spike high 2850.00 above as the next reference levels."], "evidence_against": ["H4 context names bar 118 a possible buy climax: range 191.94 with a 126.85 upper tail (66% of the bar) and a close in the lower third, and H4 bars 119-120 contract (76.91, 35.81) below 2850.00, so this long is entered under climactic overhead supply.", "M15 bar 118 opened 2803.69 near the leg high and closed on its low 2783.49, and bar 119 could not trade back above 2784.90, so sellers were active in the last two bars; an ii is direction-neutral until it breaks.", "M15 bar 99 (h 2795.00, c 2754.31, about 41 points of upper tail) already shows this zone rejecting price, so opposing structure sits only about 10 points above the trigger.", "Since the 2850.00 spike the M15 has held roughly 2734.22-2804.59; at 2781.77 the market is in the upper third of that micro range rather than at a breakout point or a range low, so immediate follow-through is not guaranteed.", "The mirror trade (short below 2776.10 on a failed break of 2795.00) is not taken because it fights a high-relevance H4 always-in long and only one bear bar has printed with no follow-through."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the two-bar ii is the whole pullback or the start of a deeper pullback toward 2734.22-2718.09 while the H4 breakout remains intact.", "Whether the H4 bar 118 climax tail at 2850.00 caps this leg, turning the M15 into a 2718-2804 range instead of continuing.", "The D1 context is the last completed daily bar (close 2642.90) and does not contain the final day's advance to 2804.59."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A close below 2776.10 (M15 bar 119 low) breaks the ii and marks the break above 2795.00 as failed, shifting the read to a pullback toward 2734.22-2718.09.", "Follow-through closes above 2804.59 (M15 bar 117 high) would confirm the ii breakout and keep 2850.00 in play.", "Two consecutive M15 closes back below 2700.00, or a strong bear bar closing below 2658.06, would reclassify the H4 breakout as failed per the H4 transition conditions."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1790008200000, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-5"], "reason": "The snapshot is coherent: one MAIN LONG leg (wf-main-5, 0.159) matches the executor mapping (wf-exec-9) and the single FILLED fill quantity, hedge_state is single_main with unresolved false and hedge_ratio 0, and margin_health is SAFE. management_policy sets strategy_stop_required false, so the empty open_orders list is policy-compliant, and the executor config still carries stop_price 2718.09 (the recorded M15 bar 117 invalidation low) with target 2812.14. The recorded premise (breakout-pullback long above the M15 range high 2747.76 with invalidation at 2718.09) is not contradicted and is now reinforced: the newest closed M15 bar (close_time 1790008199999) opens 2746.44, runs to 2765.34, and closes 2761.07 near its high with low 2742, holding well above 2718.09 and above the 2747.76 range top, with the mark at that close and the unrealized PnL positive (+1.805). No new fill, order conflict, or unmet management condition requires an allowed intervention, so HOLD is the safest coherent step.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Single MAIN position wf-main-5, ETH-USDT LONG 0.159, entry 2749.714944, mark 2761.07, unrealized PnL +1.805453904; ownership_role MAIN and position/account as_of_ms 1790008200000 equal decisi